self.past_X.append(obs["max_value_last_round"])

bid = 0.5 * obs["x"] return max(0.0, min(bid, obs["capital"]))

Exactly the same keys as Variation 2. Only the payoff rule changes: come second and you pay a penalty. Watch obs["my last rank"] == 2 to see when you were charged.

